{"ID":"20240513083204-c6yabv6","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083204-c6yabv6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083204-c6yabv6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513150541-3rh6lvu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513150343-dw6zl1l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:840,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513150541-3rh6lvu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:843,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:843\u0026#125;","title":"174","type":"doc","updated":"20240514134154"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513150541-3rh6lvu","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1023px;","id":"20240513150541-3rh6lvu","updated":"20240514134154"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 154 B, E"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1921(87)/中等偏瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"04/02/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳癌，右乳出現幾個硬塊(如石狀)。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1、睡眠時是否感身寒或熱："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可通宵睡。 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→以此診斷是否有擴散。病人可通宵睡，表未擴散。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很好。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→因肺與大腸互為表裡，故問此。病人已停經，排便尤其重要；月經即奶水，停經者仍會產生奶水，停經後，此奶水需由排便出，寧可下痢，不可便秘。囑病人不可吃任何會產生奶水之物；如女性賀爾蒙藥物、又如注射過賀爾蒙之肉類與其產生之奶、與受藥物污染之生水等。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、身體有無寒熱："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→以此診斷有無陰陽相隔之現象。如癌移轉肝、肺， 病人會感上身熱、下身寒；此乃因夜間陽要入陰，當臟內有陰實，導致陽不入陰，此時陽會反逆而生熱。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→囑多食用自然有機之食物。因人工製造之起司、糖等，會餵食癌細胞。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、體力："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪大、稍數、中空。結代脈，時三、四次，時十七、八次一止。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→現為夏季，洪大為常脈；中空，表示血虛；脈結代，以炙甘草湯為主力處方。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃濕厚。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→厚，表濕盛；黃，表熱；故需去濕、去熱。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺區有斑(需再以耳診確認是否肺中有實，或僅是痰飲)，肝胰好，心區較扁長；有一點白內障。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→病人陳述服用HT-88(磁珠丸)後下痢，但感覺好，不感覺累。告知白內障乃由痰濕引起，服藥後，痰濕會由痢中排出。正常人服用此藥不會下痢，會下痢表示此藥在清除病人眼中痰濕。囑續服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"身體："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脊椎無壓痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"耳心點壓痛。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳癌有移轉在皮下(淋巴)。心氣不足。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炙甘草6錢 生薑2片 大棗10枚 桂枝3錢 麥冬3錢 麻仁2錢 生地3錢 阿膠3錢分三包(烊盡) → 炙甘草湯加減。治結代脈。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"當歸2錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡蠣1兩 瓦楞子5錢 → 攻堅。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃耆5錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→作藥引子。與桂枝湯合用，將藥帶到皮膚的下方、肌肉的上方。 (觸診病人淋巴腫瘤在皮膚與肌肉中間。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白芍3錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→與桂枝等量，成桂枝湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9→3碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240513143150-wkcttn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513143150-wkcttn0"}},{"ID":"20240513143253-2lmkymj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513143253-2lmkymj"}},{"ID":"20240513143325-6bavd2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513143325-6bavd2o"}},{"ID":"20240513143405-sqixjua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513143405-sqixjua"}},{"ID":"20240513150343-dw6zl1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513150343-dw6zl1l"}}]}